@startuml
title Exact stale-sibling settlement and single-owner recovery

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #29434E
  LifeLineBorderColor #546E7A
  ParticipantBorderColor #37474F
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
}

participant "Validator 1" as V1
participant "Validator 2" as V2
participant "Validator 3" as V3
participant "Finalizer and settlement" as F
participant "Rejected-occurrence buffer" as R

par independent ordinary admission
  V1 -> F: accept siblings A and B
else
  V2 -> F: accept B, then A
else
  V3 -> F: accept A, then B
end

V1 -> F: exact support for B
V2 -> F: exact support for B
V3 -> F: exact support for B
F --> V1: publish finalized floor B
F --> V2: publish finalized floor B
F --> V3: publish finalized floor B
note over V1,V3 #FFF3E0
A remains an accepted causal input.
A is no longer a finality vote for floor B.
end note

V1 -> F: settle exact frontier {A, B}
F -> F: replay preserves B
F -> R: tombstone exact occurrence (A signature, A source)
par independent settlement observation
  R --> V1: buffer rejected occurrence A
else
  R --> V2: buffer rejected occurrence A
else
  R --> V3: buffer rejected occurrence A
end

V1 -> F: elected recovery proposes {A, Fresh}
V2 -[#B71C1C,dashed]> F: nonleader retry denied
V3 -[#B71C1C,dashed]> F: nonleader retry denied
V2 -> F: support recovered descendant
V3 -> F: support recovered descendant
F --> V1: finalize effects {A, B, Fresh}
F --> V2: finalize effects {A, B, Fresh}
F --> V3: finalize effects {A, B, Fresh}
note over V1,V3 #E8F5E9
All validators converge without dropping the floor,
duplicating A, or serializing ordinary validation.
end note
@enduml
